MeshTransit is distributed under two open-source licenses, chosen per directory.

AGPL-3.0-only (see LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt):
  core/     MeshTransit Core, the control plane
  relay/    MeshTransit Interchange (meshrelay), the relay

  MeshTransit-owned code in these directories is also available under a
  separate commercial license; see COMMERCIAL-LICENSING.md.

Apache-2.0 (see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt):
  client/   meshd, meshnetd, meshcred and meshctl
  shared/   protocol libraries used by the client, the relay and Core
  api/      API and protocol contracts
  and every other file in this repository unless a LICENSE file in its
  directory, or a notice in the file itself, states otherwise.

A LICENSE file inside a directory applies to that directory and everything
below it. Third-party components keep their own licenses; see
core/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, client/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the
third_party/ directories.

